(7574448, 1216093, 138630, '<td valign="top">My stand alone 10 and I''m delighted to see it with the Blue.  I didn''t read the challenge description as literally as some, I guess.  I just figured it meant you wandered around the house looking for possible subjects - piano, music . . . how can I take a photo of music . . . I know, I''ll play around with this laser.  And you succeeded wildly.  But you will NEVER get to sleep if that''s what''s playing in your head.  Congratulations.</td>', 'My stand alone 10 and I''m delighted to see it with the Blue.  I didn''t read the challenge description as literally as some, I guess.  I just figured it meant you wandered around the house looking for possible subjects - piano, music . . . how can I take a photo of music . . . I know, I''ll play around with this laser.  And you succeeded wildly.  But you will NEVER get to sleep if that''s what''s playing in your head.  Congratulations.', '2018-06-29 01:08:37.000000', NULL, 0),
